Generally i choose between 3 monsters.  Jabberwock, Nazgul, and Vampire Lord.

Advantages being:

For the Jabberwock:  Four hefty attacks plus a bite, and you fly.  Bad parts
	are that you can't wear cloaks or armor.  Boots, gloves, helmet fine,
	but remember to remove that DSM.

For the Nazgul:  You are undead, therefore immune to touch of death.
	You can halfway reliably breathe sleep gas.
	Your second attack level drains.  Fearsome in combo with Stormy.
	Vampire lords are boring after awhile, and Nazgul has more style.

For the Vampire Lord:  Same touch-of-death protection.
	You fly.  You regenerate.  You get second attack to level drain.

Both nazgul and vamp lord can wear a full set of armor, and get HEFTY ac bonus.
In general, polymorphing into a monster is most useful so that you can get a 
little sloppy at watching hp's.  When you revert to human, its time to pull out
the trump cards.  Wands of death and the like.

That's my preferances, anyway.
